title: Authorizations › Case page › Draft › Read and edit
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042?tab=draft
intro: The main column of 'Clinical picture & draft': the medical necessity request Scribe wrote, section by section, each with its source chips; how sentences from applied actions and added clinical context appear; and how a person edits and saves it. It is the same summary Review & submit shows in New Case, so an edit made in either place is read in the other.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Clinical picture & draft'\n(or open ?tab=draft)"
screen dr "Main column: card 'Medical necessity request'\n'Version 3 · Scribe · Tue 10:21 am'\nThe clinical picture rail beside it"
process sec "Sections, each a heading, the text and its source chips\n'Clinical picture', 'Why a lower level of care is not safe', 'Current severity', 'Plan'\nThe text is the request's draft in New Case (before it has one, the text that draft would have)"
process cx "A section 'Context added' when notes were added with 'Add clinical context'\nshown, not edited here"
process nw "Sentences from applied actions follow in a green mark with a 'New' tag\nEach adds its own chip, e.g. 'Your answer'"
process lit "'In draft' or 'Show in draft' in the clinical picture lights the sections that use that item"
click ch "Click a source chip"
goto gC "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Source chip"
goto gP "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Clinical picture"

click ed "Click 'Edit'"
screen em "Edit mode\nOne text box per section, e.g. 'Edit Plan'\nHeader buttons 'Cancel' and 'Save changes'"
input ty "Change the text in one or more boxes"
click cn "Click 'Cancel'"
process cd "Edit mode closes\nNothing is saved"
click sv "Click 'Save changes'"
decision dCh "Did any box change?"
toast tn "'No changes to save'"
store sd "Edited sections saved, with the sentences already added by applied actions\nNew version 'Edited by you'\nHistory: 'You edited the draft ...' flagged 'Logged decision'\nThe same text is saved on the request's draft in New Case"
toast ts "'Draft saved'\n'Integrity reads it again before it can be signed.'"
process dy "'Every sentence matches the chart' now warns\nthe header chip drops to 'Integrity 3/4', 'Send to payer' goes off\nthe 'Integrity checks' fold opens with 'Re-check'"
process bd "Badge on 'Clinical picture & draft' goes up by one"
process lt "Actions applied later add their sentences after the edited text"
goto gK "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Draft › Checks, versions and send back"
goto gR "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Review & submit › The draft and the summary"

s1 --> dr --> sec --> nw
sec --> ch --> gC
sec --> cx
dr --> lit --> gP
dr --> ed --> em --> ty
em --> cn --> cd
em --> sv --> dCh
dCh -->|No| tn
dCh -->|Yes| sd --> ts
sd --> dy --> bd
dy --> gK
sd -.-> lt
sd --> gR
